{"seq":1,"slug":"reshaping-industries","title":"重塑多个行业","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/influence-and-legacy/reshaping-industries","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"computing-and-music","title":"计算与音乐","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/influence-and-legacy/reshaping-industries/computing-and-music","wordCount":1866,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"phones-and-mobile-computing","title":"手机与移动计算","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/influence-and-legacy/reshaping-industries/phones-and-mobile-computing","wordCount":1636,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 重塑多个行业\n\n乔布斯的影响，首先体现在他对一系列行业的彻底重塑。本章考察他改写规则、重定格局的两大领域。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"计算与音乐\"——他如何在个人计算与音乐产业中，不只是参与者，而是改写规则的关键人物。第二篇文档讲述\"手机与移动计算\"，揭示他如何以 iPhone 开启移动互联网时代，深刻改变了数十亿人的生活方式。\n"}